{"c":"443014","n":"CHOMUTOVKA 3","t":"P","s":"SČ","o":"Chomutov","url":"443014-chomutovka-3","stav":"2026-10-06","popis":"Přítok Ohře. Od silničního mostu v Chomutově u Červeného mlýna ř. km 28 až k pramenům. Celý revír mimo Hamerský rybník je chráněnou rybí oblastí (dle rozhodnutí OkÚ Chomutov, č. j. RŽP-III-Bo/2284/00/2) – lov ryb zakázán. \nDo revíru patří:\n\n**1. Hamerský rybník**\tv k. ú. Chomutov\t1,6 ha\n(GPS 50°28'20.336\"N, 13°23'26.425\"E)\n\nNa podrevíru Hamerský rybník je povolen lov z plavidel typu belly boat v počtu max. 2 kusů současně.\nZákaz zavážení nástrah a návnad, zákaz umisťování bójek na vodní hladinu.","delka":17,"rozloha":7,"lat":50.472725,"lon":13.3893,"mo_web":"https://www.rybsvaz.cz/mo/-/chomutov","mo_tel":"","mo_mail":"crs-chomutov@seznam.cz","doba":[{"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-10-31","h":"07:00–19:00","zakaz":false}],"kratkodobe":[],"miry":[{"d":"Amur bílý","min":50,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Bolen dravý","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":"povinnost ponechat si"},{"d":"Candát obecný","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Cejn velký","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Hlavatka obecná","min":65,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-10-01","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec jesen","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":true,"od":"2026-01-01","do":"2026-12-31","pozn":""},{"d":"Jelec tloušť","min":null,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":"povinnost ponechat si"},{"d":"Jeseter malý","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Kapr obecný","min":40,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Lín obecný","min":20,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od":"2026-04-16","do":"2026-11-30","pozn":""},{"d":"Lipan podhorní","min":30,"max":null,"hajen":false,"od